{
  "answer_markdown": "The MistralAI-User crawler is used for user actions in Vibe. When a user asks Vibe a question, it may visit a web page to gather information and include a link to the source in its response [1].\n\nIt does **not** automatically crawl the web or collect content for AI training [1].\n\n```\nMistralAI-User is for **user actions in Vibe**. When users ask Vibe a question, it may **visit a web page** to help answer and **include a link to the source in its response**.\n\nMistralAI-User governs which sites these user requests can be made to. It is **not used for crawling the web in any automatic fashion, nor to crawl content for generative AI training**.\n```",
  "citations": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "quote": "MistralAI-User is for **user actions in Vibe**. When users ask Vibe a question, it may **visit a web page** to help answer and **include a link to the source in its response**."
